 "notes": "In P13 and P20, the review's numerical conversions from mini-Brillouin-zone fractional area to filling factor nu omit the factor of 4 from spin-valley degeneracy (full filling of the first miniband is nu = 4, corresponding to n_s ~ 5.8e12 cm^-2 at 1.58 deg, so nu = 0.1 is ~1.45e11 cm^-2 rather than 6e11 cm^-2, and the circular-pocket umklapp thresholds are nu ~ 0.60 and 3.09 rather than 0.15 and 3.77). Both P13 and P20 are therefore marked incorrect. Several referee concerns (C5, C10, C11, C20, C25) relied on Supplementary Information figures unavailable to the review author.",
